guide forever/horde/50-60/01-un-goro-crater
title Un'Goro Crater, Eastern Plaguelands & Burning Steppes
faction Horde
levels 50-53
zone Un'Goro Crater
next forever/horde/50-60/02-felwood
# Built from the playthrough simulator's consensus route (Horde, visits
# 65-69) and machine-checked with lint; not play-tested on Forever yet.
#
# Flow: Broken Pillar -> down into Un'Goro Crater -> Marshal's Refuge (flight
# path) -> loop 1, anticlockwise: tar pits, the western jungle, the
# south-west, the Gorishi hive, the raft, Torwa, the eastern jungle, the
# gorillas, Fire Plume Ridge (Ringo) -> escort Ringo to the refuge -> loop 2:
# northern pylon, eastern pylon, Lar'korwi, Torwa, western pylon, Krakle,
# Fire Plume Ridge's vent, Krakle -> refuge -> hearth to Gadgetzan -> fly to
# Orgrimmar (Hunters and Shamans train; Druids train in Thunder Bluff on the
# way), zeppelin to Grom'gol, fly to Kargath -> ride through Blackrock
# Mountain to Flame Crest (flight path) -> broodlings -> Dreadmaul Rock ->
# Thaurissan dig site -> Flame Crest -> fly to Kargath -> fly to the
# Undercity (training for the other classes) -> the Bulwark -> ride
# east to the Eastern Plaguelands: Terrordale -> Light's Hope Chapel (flight
# path, bind) -> Darrowshire -> hearth to Light's Hope Chapel, where the next
# guide starts.
#
# Deviations from the export:
# - Un'Goro is two loops: Torwa's chain is picked up before the gorillas so
#   their parts drop on the first pass, and Lar'korwi's bait waits for the
#   second loop, which passes his lair and Torwa again. J.D. Collie's crystals
#   are gathered on the first loop.
# - Finding the Source (974) needs level 51, which loop 1 starts below: Krakle
#   is visited on loop 2 instead, with a ride east to Fire Plume Ridge's vent
#   and back (about three minutes), instead of a grind before loop 1.
# - Dropped: The Mighty U'cha (4301): U'cha lives in the north-east cave and
#   Torwa in the south-east corner, so it costs two extra crossings of the
#   crater for 5,650 XP.
# - Grind: level 52 at the Lakkari Tar Pits before leaving the crater, so
#   The Rise of the Machines (4061, Kargath) can be taken on arrival.
# - Super Sticky (4504) and Bungle in the Jungle (4496) are turned in when the
#   hearth lands in Gadgetzan instead of on a later Tanaris visit.
# - The Kargath bind is dropped (replaced unused); the Light's Hope Chapel
#   bind is made on arrival there, not in the Badlands.
# - The Undercity and Bulwark stops of the previous guide's export (visits
#   56, 60, 61) are made here, on the way to the Plaguelands: Andron Gant
#   (3542/3564), A Call to Arms (5094), Seeping Corruption (3568), Scarlet
#   Diversions (5096), Argent Dawn Commission (5405), the Bulwark's
#   Scourgestones (5407, 5408) and A Plague Upon Thee (5901). A Call to Arms
#   is handed in on the spot.
# - Eastern Plaguelands: Terrordale first, since the road from the west
#   passes it; Pamela's doll and Zaeldarr are done in one trip south-west from
#   the chapel.
# - Dropped: The Rise of the Machines part 2 (4062: a detour to Lotwil for
#   1,350 XP), Dark Iron Legacy (3801: Franclorn is a ghost only a dead
#   character can see), Vivian Lagrave (4133: not taken, see the previous
#   guide) and Yuka Screwspigot (4324).
# - Optional: the Scourgestone turn-ins (5407, 5408, 5509, 5510). They are
#   repeatable Argent Dawn turn-ins and need 20 Minion's or 10 Invader's
#   Scourgestones each, which only drop while the Argent Dawn Commission is
#   equipped; hand them in whenever you have enough.
# - Back at Marshal's Refuge, Shizzle at the entrance first; in the
#   Undercity, Harbinger Balthazad beside the bat master first.
#
# Left open for later guides: The New Springs (980) and It's a Secret to
# Everybody (3908, Donova Snowden), Marvon's Workshop (4147), Felnok
# Steelspring (4808, Everlook), Auntie Marlene (5152), Scarlet Diversions
# (5096), A Plague Upon Thee (5901), Andron's Payment to Jediga (3564),
# Seeping Corruption (3568), Bone-Bladed Weapons (4300) and Un'Goro Soil
# (3761).
#
# Left out (not in the route): Dadanga is Hungry! (5150) and the pylon buffs
# (4381-4386, no experience), Chasing A-Me 01 parts 2-3 (Engineering) and Pawn
# Captures Queen (4507, elite boss).
#
# Checked and not added: The Mighty U'cha (4301) is still out (see above).
# Linken's Adventure (3961) needs Aquementas (4005), the end of Linken's
# Felwood and Tanaris chain, which no guide does before here. Target:
# Writhing Haunt and its return (5233, 5234) and Mission Accomplished! (5238)
# need the earlier cauldrons (5229-5232, 5235-5236). The route only starts the
# cauldrons in the next guide and finishes them at 58.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Marshal's Refuge

step Into Un'Goro Crater
  tip From the Broken Pillar ride west to the long ramp that winds down into Un'Goro Crater, then follow the crater's north wall to Marshal's Refuge, a camp in the cliff caves. Everyone here is neutral.
  getfp "Marshal's Refuge"
  accept 3881                         -- Williden Marshal
  accept 3883                         -- Hol'anyee Marshal
  accept 3882                         -- Spark Nilminer
  accept 4501                         -- The wooden sign beside Spraggle
  accept 4492                         -- Spraggle Frock
  accept 4145                         -- Larion
  accept 4284                         -- J.D. Collie, at the back of the cave

step Out of the refuge
  accept 4503                         -- Shizzle, at the refuge entrance
  accept 4243                         -- Karna Remtravel, just outside
  note From here on pick up every Power Crystal (blue, green, red, yellow) and every Un'Goro Soil pile you pass: 25 soil in all, 20 for Hamuul and 5 for Pestlezugg.

step Lakkari Tar Pits
  tip The tar pits lie just south of the refuge. Tar Beasts, Lurkers and Creepers drop the Super Sticky Tar.
  collect 11834 quest 4504

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Loop 1: west and south-west

step Western jungle
  tip Ride south-west along the western cliffs. Frenzied Pterrordax fly over the west side, and Bloodpetal Trappers grow in the same jungle.
  kill 9167 quest 4501.2
  kill 6512 quest 4145.2

step Stegodons and ravasaurs
  tip South of the hot springs, Stegodons graze and Dinosaur Bones drop from them or lie on the ground; Diemetradons nearby carry the scales Shizzle wants. Ravasaurs hunt in packs in the south-west: their claws are for Jes'rimon, and now and then one carries a Mangled Journal (a rare drop: take its quest only if you get one). Avoid Gruff, a level 57 Stegodon.
  collect 11114 quest 3882
  collect 11830 quest 4503.1
  collect 11477 quest 4300
  collect 11116 optional              -- A Mangled Journal, a rare drop
  accept 3884 optional                -- Use the Mangled Journal to start it

step Research Equipment
  tip The expedition's lost equipment lies in the south-west jungle.
  collect 11112 quest 3881.2 @38.5,66.1

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Loop 1: south and south-east

step The Gorishi hive
  tip The silithid hive fills the south of the crater. Gorishi wasps and workers drop the scent gland; use the Scraping Vial on the egg mass inside the first chamber. The Hive Queen at the bottom is an elite boss: stay out of her chamber. Pterrordax nest on the cliffs above the hive; their scales are for Shizzle.
  collect 11837 quest 4496.1
  collect 11131 quest 3883 @48.7,85.3
  kill 9166 quest 4501.1
  collect 11831 quest 4503.2

step A Wrecked Raft
  tip The raft lies on the shore of the south-eastern lake; the small pack sits in the water beside it.
  accept 3844
  turnin 3844
  accept 3845
  collect 11104 quest 3845 @63.1,69.1
  collect 11105 quest 3845 @63.1,69.1
  collect 11106 quest 3845 @63.1,69.1

step Torwa Pathfinder
  tip Torwa camps in the south-east corner of the crater.
  accept 4289
  accept 4290

step Fresh Threshadon Carcass
  tip North of Torwa, a dead Threshadon lies by the water.
  collect 11504 quest 4290

step Torwa Pathfinder
  turnin 4290
  accept 4291

step Lar'korwi Mates
  tip The Lar'korwi Mates prowl the jungle north-west of Torwa.
  collect 11509 quest 4291

step Torwa Pathfinder
  turnin 4291
  accept 4292
  note Keep the bait: Lar'korwi is level 56, and the second loop passes his lair.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Loop 1: east and north-east

step Lashers and Threshers
  tip Ride north along the east side. Bloodpetal Lashers and Threshers fill the jungle.
  kill 6509 quest 4145.1
  kill 6511 quest 4145.4

step Crate of Foodstuffs
  tip The expedition's crate sits at an abandoned camp in the eastern jungle.
  collect 11113 quest 3881.1 @68.5,36.5

step Gorillas
  tip The gorillas live on the north-east plateau. Stay out of the deepest cave: U'cha lives there.
  collect 11478 quest 4289
  collect 11479 quest 4289
  collect 11480 quest 4289
  turnin 4243                         -- A-Me 01, the robot on the plateau
  note A-Me 01 then wants a Mithril Casing, an Engineering item. Skip it unless you have one.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Loop 1: Fire Plume Ridge

step Bloodpetal Flayers
  tip Ride south-west to Fire Plume Ridge, the volcano in the middle of the crater. Bloodpetal Flayers grow around its foot.
  kill 6510 quest 4145.3

step Power Crystals and soil
  tip The crystal clusters stand all over the crater, many around Fire Plume Ridge. Take a few extra of each colour for the pylons.
  collect 11184 quest 4284.4
  collect 11185 quest 4284.3
  collect 11186 quest 4284.1
  collect 11188 quest 4284.2
  collect 11018 quest 3761
  collect 11018 quest 4496.2

step Ringo
  tip Ringo sits on the ridge, lost and exhausted.
  turnin 4492
  accept 4491

step Escort Ringo
  tip Lead Ringo north to Marshal's Refuge. When he faints, use Spraggle's Canteen on him to wake him.
  complete 4491

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Back at the refuge

step Marshal's Refuge
  turnin 4503                         -- Shizzle, at the entrance
  turnin 4491                         -- Spraggle Frock
  turnin 4501
  turnin 4145                         -- Larion
  accept 4147
  turnin 3845                         -- Linken
  accept 3908
  turnin 3881                         -- Williden Marshal
  turnin 3884 optional
  turnin 3883                         -- Hol'anyee Marshal
  turnin 3882                         -- Spark Nilminer
  turnin 4284                         -- J.D. Collie
  accept 4285
  accept 4287
  accept 4288
  note Keep Larion's Marvon's Workshop and Linken's letter for later guides.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Loop 2: the pylons

step Northern Pylon
  tip The pylon stands on the slope east of the refuge.
  goto 56.5,12.5 "Northern Crystal Pylon"
  complete 4285

step Eastern Pylon
  tip Ride down the east side of the crater to the pylon on the eastern cliffs.
  goto 77.2,50.0 "Eastern Crystal Pylon"
  complete 4287

step Lar'korwi
  tip Lar'korwi's lair is just south of the pylon. Use Torwa's bait there; Lar'korwi is level 56 and hits hard, so start at full health.
  collect 11510 quest 4292

step Torwa Pathfinder
  turnin 4289
  turnin 4292
  note Torwa now asks for U'cha's pelt, back in the north-east cave: skip it.

step Western Pylon
  tip Cross the south of the crater to the pylon on the western cliffs.
  goto 23.9,59.2 "Western Crystal Pylon"
  complete 4288

step Krakle
  tip Krakle the goblin sits at Golakka Hot Springs, just east of the pylon.
  accept 974

step Krakle's Thermometer
  tip Ride east to Fire Plume Ridge, climb it and use Krakle's Thermometer at the lava vent near the top, then ride back west to Krakle.
  complete 974 @49.7,45.6

step Krakle
  turnin 974
  accept 980
  note Krakle sends you to Donova Snowden in Winterspring: keep it.

step J.D. Collie
  tip Ride north back to Marshal's Refuge.
  turnin 4285
  turnin 4287
  turnin 4288
  accept 4321
  turnin 4321

step Lakkari Tar Pits
  tip Theodora's quest in Kargath needs level 52. The Tar Lurkers and Tar Lords just south of the refuge are the closest camp.
  level 52 -- grind on Tar Lurkers at Lakkari Tar Pits, Un'Goro Crater

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Gadgetzan

step Gadgetzan
  zone Tanaris
  hearth "Gadgetzan"
  turnin 4504                         -- Tran'rek
  turnin 4496                         -- Alchemist Pestlezugg
  note Pestlezugg's next quest needs the Gorishi Hive Queen, an elite boss. Skip it.

step Orgrimmar
  only Hunter,Shaman
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Fly to Orgrimmar and train before the Grom'gol zeppelin: the Undercity stop later in this guide has no Hunter or Shaman trainer.
  fly "Orgrimmar"
  train class

step Thunder Bluff
  only Druid
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip Fly to Thunder Bluff and train with Turak Runetotem on Elder Rise, then fly to Orgrimmar for the Grom'gol zeppelin.
  fly "Thunder Bluff"
  train class

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Kargath

step Fly to Kargath
  zone Badlands
  tip Fly to Orgrimmar, take the zeppelin to Grom'gol and fly from there to Kargath, built into the cliffs on the Badlands' west edge.
  fly "Kargath"
  accept 3821                         -- Thal'trak Proudtusk
  accept 4061                         -- Hierophant Theodora Mulvadania

step Into the Searing Gorge
  zone Searing Gorge
  tip Take the pass out of Kargath's west side into the Searing Gorge, then ride south across the gorge to the long bridge into Blackrock Mountain. Inside, follow the chain walkways down and leave through the southern exit; stay off the paths to the dungeon portals.
  goto 34.8,83.0 "Bridge into Blackrock Mountain"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Burning Steppes

step Flame Crest
  zone Burning Steppes
  tip The mountain lets you out beside Blackrock Stronghold, full of 55-57 orcs. Follow the road east along the northern cliffs to the Horde camp at Flame Crest.
  getfp "Flame Crest"
  accept 4296                         -- Maxwort Uberglint
  accept 4726                         -- Tinkee Steamboil

step Black Broodlings
  tip Black Broodlings nest in the hills just east of Flame Crest. Use Tinkee's Draco-Incarcinatrix 900 on a broodling when it is almost dead to capture its essence.
  collect 12283 quest 4726 @81.0,28.0

step Sha'ni Proudtusk
  tip Follow the cliffs south to Dreadmaul Rock, the Firegut ogres' hill. Sha'ni Proudtusk's remains lie at its foot.
  turnin 3821
  accept 3822

step Krom'Grul
  tip Krom'Grul walks the caves and mine tunnels of Dreadmaul Rock; if he isn't home, clear the ogres around the entrances until he comes back.
  collect 11058 quest 3822

step Thaurissan dig site
  tip Ride west to the dig site. War Reaver golems (53) stomp around it and drop the shards often; the Tablet of the Seven stands in its middle among the Thaurissan dwarves. Copy it.
  collect 11266 quest 4061
  collect 11470 quest 4296 @54.1,40.8

step Flame Crest
  tip Back north-east to Flame Crest.
  turnin 4296                         -- Maxwort Uberglint
  turnin 4726                         -- Tinkee Steamboil
  accept 4808
  note Keep Tinkee's letter: Felnok Steelspring is in Everlook, Winterspring.

step Kargath
  zone Badlands
  fly "Kargath"
  turnin 3822                         -- Thal'trak Proudtusk
  turnin 4061                         -- Hierophant Theodora Mulvadania
  note Theodora's next errand goes to Lotwil east of town and then into Blackrock Depths: skip it.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Undercity and the Bulwark

step Undercity
  zone Undercity
  fly "Undercity"
  accept 5094                         -- Harbinger Balthazad, the Trade Quarter, beside the bat master
  turnin 3542                         -- Andron Gant, the Rogues' Quarter
  accept 3564
  accept 3568                         -- Chemist Cuely, the Apothecarium: the vials fill in Azshara later
  train class only Warrior,Paladin,Rogue,Priest,Mage,Warlock

step The Bulwark
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  tip Leave the Undercity and ride east along the road through Tirisfal Glades to the Bulwark, the Forsaken fort on the border.
  turnin 5094                         -- High Executor Derrington
  accept 5096
  accept 5405                         -- Argent Officer Garush
  turnin 5405
  accept 5407 optional
  accept 5408 optional
  accept 5901                         -- Mickey Levine
  note Take a Box of Incendiaries from the crate next to Derrington for Scarlet Diversions, done on the way back. Equip the Argent Dawn Commission: Scourgestones only drop while you wear it.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Eastern Plaguelands

step Augustus the Touched
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip Follow the road east through the Western Plaguelands and across the river into the Eastern Plaguelands; leave it north for Terrordale, the ruined town in the north-west. Augustus sits in a hut at its edge.
  accept 6164

step Augustus' Receipt Book
  tip The book lies in the ruined inn of Terrordale.
  collect 15884 quest 6164 @17.4,31.1

step Augustus the Touched
  turnin 6164

step Termite mounds
  tip The Large Termite Mounds stand all over the hills east of Terrordale. Use the Empty Termite Jar on each mound you pass.
  collect 15043 quest 5901

step Light's Hope Chapel
  tip Ride south back to the road and follow it east across the whole zone to Light's Hope Chapel.
  getfp "Light's Hope Chapel"
  sethome "Light's Hope Chapel"
  accept 5211                         -- Carlin Redpath
  accept 6021                         -- Caretaker Alen
  accept 5509 optional                -- Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff
  accept 5510 optional

step Darrowshire Spirits
  tip With Carlin's quest in your log, slain Scourge sometimes leave a Darrowshire Spirit; talk to it to free it. Kill undead on the ride south-west to Darrowshire.
  kill 11064 quest 5211.1 "Free Darrowshire Spirits: talk to them"
  collect 12840 quest 5510 optional
  collect 12841 quest 5509 optional

step Pamela Redpath
  tip Pamela's ghost stands in the ruins of Darrowshire, in the south-west.
  accept 5149

step Pamela's Doll
  tip The doll's head and its two sides lie in the houses around Pamela; join them from your bags.
  collect 12886
  collect 12887
  collect 12888
  collect 12885 quest 5149 @38.5,91.4

step Pamela Redpath
  turnin 5149
  accept 5152
  accept 5241
  note Keep Auntie Marlene: Marlene lives at Sorrow Hill in the Western Plaguelands.

step Zaeldarr the Outcast
  tip Zaeldarr lurks just west of Darrowshire.
  collect 15785 quest 6021

step Back to Light's Hope Chapel
  hearth "Light's Hope Chapel"
  turnin 6021                         -- Caretaker Alen
  turnin 5241                         -- Carlin Redpath
  turnin 5211
  turnin 5509 optional                -- Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff
  turnin 5510 optional
  note The next guide starts here, at the chapel's flight master.
